{"author":{"id":"8022379585b4ab99ca8775db3eb67d33fcb256817114c28e51ccc1e9f55cdec4"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1793006899,"nonce":"ejHT+ACWfB5Y8ZljWan5VUMdF3I=","title":"Schedule page indexing cooperatively and merge partial results by source generation","message":"The typing worker drains notifications and then compiles changed documents synchronously. A fresh tab without a completed cache cannot start or answer requests until the preceding file finishes. The actual MenusPart.hx probe produced no document result within its 600-second debug-server timeout. Document checking state can therefore outlive the user's active tab for a long time.\n\nUse per-document stackful compiler tasks with bounded active graphs and cooperative checkpoints in macro execution and expression lowering. Keep requests and notifications flowing between slices, admit newly active work ahead of background pages, and cancel/unwind superseded or closed tasks rather than dropping suspended Rust stacks. Preserve each task's macro allowance and invocation state across suspension. Reuse completed graphs and BLADE data, and reject old-version diagnostics/results.\n\nCache facts belong to a source/configuration fingerprint. Merge independent partial name/member blocks while remapping block-local response offsets. A late partial result cannot downgrade completion; a result for old text cannot overwrite a new generation. Partial hints must remain readable before completion. This borrows monotonic merge and generation isolation from CRDT designs without distributing compiler-local symbol identities.\n\nAcceptance: start an infinite-loop macro and wait for its marker, then a new fast document must finish before the slow one. Editing that suspended document must publish only the new version. Shutdown must unwind active tasks. Partial joins must preserve answers in either order and on duplicate delivery; stale partial and complete results must not replace a current-generation cache. The broader synchronization backlog remains c7864710dd6916b7c3ed11f39f890a836f24a898fb3ac4e113a9f2f2d931c487.","files":null}]}